1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,870
Hamburgers, egg pancakes, sizzling noodles

2
00:00:02,870 --> 00:00:06,006
Rice balls, toast, and savory soy milk

3
00:00:06,006 --> 00:00:09,142
There are so many delicious breakfasts
around the world

4
00:00:09,142 --> 00:00:13,480
I'm going to collect them all in my
breakfast truck

5
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:14,214
And so,

6
00:00:14,214 --> 00:00:16,283
Beelu, who loves breakfast,

7
00:00:16,283 --> 00:00:18,752
set off on an adventure to collect

8
00:00:18,752 --> 00:00:20,554
all kinds of breakfast!

9
00:00:55,656 --> 00:00:57,658
That was fun!

10
00:00:59,993 --> 00:01:02,129
Let's find breakfast!

11
00:01:02,129 --> 00:01:04,798
Good morning, Beelu! Good morning, kids!

12
00:01:04,798 --> 00:01:07,601
Today's breakfast is soup dumplings

13
00:01:07,601 --> 00:01:09,536
In the adventure story coming up,

14
00:01:09,536 --> 00:01:12,205
there will be three soup dumpling stickers

15
00:01:12,205 --> 00:01:13,807
Help Beelu

16
00:01:13,807 --> 00:01:16,076
find where they are!

17
00:01:16,076 --> 00:01:18,412
Let's collect today's breakfast!

18
00:01:24,151 --> 00:01:25,352
Wow, Brother Pang!

19
00:01:25,352 --> 00:01:26,687
You're amazing!

20
00:01:26,687 --> 00:01:29,823
You can pull the breakfast truck so fast!

21
00:01:30,624 --> 00:01:32,492
That's nothing

22
00:01:32,492 --> 00:01:34,494
As long as you swim with the ocean
current,

23
00:01:34,494 --> 00:01:37,230
anyone can swim fast

24
00:01:38,498 --> 00:01:39,700
But, Beelu,

25
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:41,969
what are you going to do on that island?

26
00:01:42,703 --> 00:01:44,638
Oh, I heard that today

27
00:01:44,638 --> 00:01:48,909
there's a super-delicious soup dumpling
breakfast shop setting up a stall there

28
00:01:48,909 --> 00:01:51,712
I love soup dumplings!

29
00:01:52,646 --> 00:01:54,648
I see

30
00:01:54,648 --> 00:01:56,316
Then I'll speed up!

31
00:01:58,986 --> 00:02:01,188
Brother Pang, once we get to the island,

32
00:02:01,188 --> 00:02:02,322
you have to try them too

33
00:02:02,322 --> 00:02:04,458
at that soup dumpling breakfast shop

34
00:02:05,859 --> 00:02:07,327
That won't be necessary!

35
00:02:07,327 --> 00:02:09,129
Huh? Why not?

36
00:02:14,134 --> 00:02:16,737
Come on, Brother Pang! Let's go!

37
00:02:16,737 --> 00:02:18,605
Let's go eat soup dumplings together!

38
00:02:20,474 --> 00:02:23,543
Beelu, actually...

39
00:02:26,079 --> 00:02:29,149
I'm the owner of the soup dumpling
breakfast shop

40
00:02:38,025 --> 00:02:40,560
Where's my steamer lid?

41
00:02:41,161 --> 00:02:45,165
Great! I finally found a clean home!

42
00:02:45,165 --> 00:02:46,166
Hey, hermit crab!

43
00:02:46,166 --> 00:02:47,634
That's my steamer lid!

44
00:02:47,634 --> 00:02:49,970
Huh? Finders keepers!

45
00:02:49,970 --> 00:02:52,372
Oh? Then don't blame me for getting rough!

46
00:02:58,578 --> 00:03:02,049
Darn! This time I'll use my real skills!

47
00:03:09,189 --> 00:03:11,525
Brother Pang, are you okay?

48
00:03:12,325 --> 00:03:14,194
He's too strong

49
00:03:14,194 --> 00:03:16,797
I can't get close to him at all

50
00:03:16,797 --> 00:03:18,398
What should I do?

51
00:03:21,601 --> 00:03:24,204
Let's think of a way to help Brother Pang

52
00:03:26,473 --> 00:03:30,077
Circle your left hand, circle your right hand

53
00:03:30,077 --> 00:03:32,212
Clap! Clap!

54
00:03:32,212 --> 00:03:32,546
Jump up!

55
00:03:32,546 --> 00:03:33,680
Jump up!

56
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:37,551
Move your left brain, move your right
brain

57
00:03:37,551 --> 00:03:39,953
Clap! Clap!

58
00:03:39,953 --> 00:03:41,755
Bi Ru Akokay

59
00:03:48,762 --> 00:03:52,232
Beelu, will this trick really work?

60
00:03:52,232 --> 00:03:53,767
It'll definitely work

61
00:03:59,306 --> 00:04:00,173
What's that sound?

62
00:04:03,176 --> 00:04:05,712
Oh, it's a cloud

63
00:04:18,925 --> 00:04:21,461
Oh, it's a seagull

64
00:04:34,474 --> 00:04:38,545
Oh, it's a plastic cup and a plastic bowl

65
00:04:39,279 --> 00:04:42,349
The beaches have been getting dirtier
lately

66
00:04:49,823 --> 00:04:51,024
Don't run!

67
00:04:51,558 --> 00:04:53,160
Give me back my house!

68
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:55,228
That's not your house!

69
00:04:55,228 --> 00:04:56,296
Give it back!

70
00:04:56,296 --> 00:04:57,164
No!

71
00:04:57,164 --> 00:05:00,767
It's the house I was going to give my
beloved on our wedding day

72
00:05:00,767 --> 00:05:03,570
Then why don't you find a seashell?

73
00:05:03,570 --> 00:05:04,971
Give it back!

74
00:05:04,971 --> 00:05:06,239
Run! Run!

75
00:05:11,711 --> 00:05:13,246
The beach is so dirty

76
00:05:13,246 --> 00:05:16,049
I can't find a single seashell

77
00:05:17,784 --> 00:05:19,853
Brother Pang, what's wrong?

78
00:05:22,055 --> 00:05:24,858
I understand how he feels

79
00:05:24,858 --> 00:05:28,728
I often travel to different beaches to
sell soup dumplings too

80
00:05:28,728 --> 00:05:31,865
But the beaches have been getting dirtier
lately

81
00:05:31,865 --> 00:05:34,000
No tourists come anymore

82
00:05:35,669 --> 00:05:37,671
I really want to help him

83
00:05:37,671 --> 00:05:40,874
But I can't give him my only steamer lid

84
00:05:41,341 --> 00:05:43,276
What should I do?

85
00:05:46,146 --> 00:05:47,480
Brother Pang,

86
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:50,083
let's do the Breakfast Brain Workout again

87
00:05:50,083 --> 00:05:51,618
and think of a solution!

88
00:06:10,237 --> 00:06:11,972
It's Brain Workout Time!

89
00:06:11,972 --> 00:06:15,775
Circle your left hand, circle your right hand

90
00:06:15,775 --> 00:06:17,510
Clap! Clap!

91
00:06:17,510 --> 00:06:19,379
Jump up!

92
00:06:19,379 --> 00:06:23,116
Move your left brain, move your right
brain

93
00:06:23,116 --> 00:06:24,985
Clap! Clap!

94
00:06:24,985 --> 00:06:26,720
Jump up!

95
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:30,323
Make a sun with your hands and say good
morning

96
00:06:30,323 --> 00:06:32,726
Clap! Clap!

97
00:06:32,726 --> 00:06:34,527
Bi Ru Akokay

98
00:06:37,397 --> 00:06:40,000
Oh, I've got a great idea!

99
00:06:45,472 --> 00:06:48,541
Hello! We're here to help you find
seashells!

100
00:06:48,541 --> 00:06:51,344
Brother Pang is a fast swimmer

101
00:06:51,344 --> 00:06:52,545
You...

102
00:06:58,818 --> 00:06:59,619
Let's go!

103
00:06:59,619 --> 00:07:00,353
Mm-hmm

104
00:07:03,156 --> 00:07:04,624
Swim with the ocean current

105
00:07:04,624 --> 00:07:07,627
and we'll find a clean beach in no time

106
00:07:13,500 --> 00:07:16,970
This place is so dirty. There are no
shells

107
00:07:25,178 --> 00:07:26,579
None here either

108
00:07:30,317 --> 00:07:31,384
None!

109
00:07:33,653 --> 00:07:35,188
Still nothing!

110
00:07:35,188 --> 00:07:38,658
Why is it so hard to find a clean beach?

111
00:07:48,601 --> 00:07:50,737
Look over there!

112
00:07:50,737 --> 00:07:53,406
It's a clean beach!

113
00:07:53,406 --> 00:07:55,408
Wow, what's that?

114
00:07:57,610 --> 00:07:59,346
We found a seashell!

115
00:08:07,153 --> 00:08:08,955
I hereby announce

116
00:08:08,955 --> 00:08:11,758
that you are officially husband and wife

117
00:08:11,758 --> 00:08:13,893
You may now exchange your homes

118
00:08:22,035 --> 00:08:23,169
Come one, come all!

119
00:08:23,169 --> 00:08:25,772
Thank you for coming from far away to the
wedding

120
00:08:25,772 --> 00:08:28,241
Have some delicious soup dumplings!

121
00:08:29,843 --> 00:08:30,643
Baby

122
00:08:30,643 --> 00:08:32,112
Let me introduce you

123
00:08:32,112 --> 00:08:35,715
This is the great person who helped us
find a seashell

124
00:08:35,715 --> 00:08:38,451
Would you like some soup dumplings?

125
00:08:38,451 --> 00:08:40,653
Honey, this place is so dirty

126
00:08:40,653 --> 00:08:42,055
How can we eat here?

127
00:08:43,056 --> 00:08:45,191
Oh, this...

128
00:08:45,191 --> 00:08:46,793
Let's get everyone to clean it up!

129
00:08:46,793 --> 00:08:48,128
There's trash everywhere

130
00:08:48,128 --> 00:08:50,597
But it'll ruin our benefactor's mood while
making breakfast

131
00:08:50,597 --> 00:08:51,664
Hey, you all!

132
00:08:51,664 --> 00:08:54,000
Don't think you can come to the wedding
and eat for free!

133
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:55,335
Get up and pick up the trash!

134
00:08:55,335 --> 00:08:57,404
Hey, don't go! Don't go!

135
00:09:04,277 --> 00:09:05,678
Once you're tired from picking up trash,

136
00:09:05,678 --> 00:09:08,481
you can come eat soup dumplings and take a
break

137
00:09:10,950 --> 00:09:12,619
They're delicious!

138
00:09:12,619 --> 00:09:14,487
That was fun!

139
00:09:23,163 --> 00:09:24,764
Let's find breakfast!

140
00:09:24,764 --> 00:09:26,699
Here are the answers!

141
00:09:26,699 --> 00:09:29,569
Today's breakfast stickers are in these
places

142
00:09:33,306 --> 00:09:34,507
Did you find them?

143
00:09:37,710 --> 00:09:40,046
Yeah, I knew it!

144
00:09:41,781 --> 00:09:44,451
How do you make delicious soup dumplings?

145
00:09:44,451 --> 00:09:45,118
First,

146
00:09:45,118 --> 00:09:48,188
cut the dough into small strips

147
00:09:48,188 --> 00:09:49,522
Pinch off small pieces

148
00:09:51,724 --> 00:09:52,392
Dust them with flour

149
00:09:52,392 --> 00:09:54,594
so the dough doesn't stick together

150
00:09:54,594 --> 00:09:55,929
Let them rest for a while

151
00:09:55,929 --> 00:09:58,131
Then flatten the dough

152
00:09:58,131 --> 00:10:00,200
Roll from the edges to make a thin wrapper

153
00:10:02,802 --> 00:10:03,803
Add the filling

154
00:10:05,405 --> 00:10:07,340
Wrap it up and pinch in the pleats

155
00:10:10,477 --> 00:10:13,012
Finally, steam them in a bamboo steamer

156
00:10:15,081 --> 00:10:18,017
And a delicious serving of soup dumplings
is ready!

157
00:10:18,017 --> 00:10:20,753
Wow, they look delicious!

158
00:10:27,227 --> 00:10:28,495
Beelu,

159
00:10:28,495 --> 00:10:31,564
do you know the secret to delicious soup
dumplings?

160
00:10:31,564 --> 00:10:33,900
Oh? What is it?

161
00:10:34,767 --> 00:10:37,303
The secret to delicious soup dumplings

162
00:10:37,303 --> 00:10:39,772
is in the pleats on top!

163
00:10:39,772 --> 00:10:40,707
Huh?

164
00:10:41,508 --> 00:10:43,643
The pleats on top of soup dumplings

165
00:10:43,643 --> 00:10:45,712
are there to pull the wrapper tight

166
00:10:45,712 --> 00:10:47,180
and seal in the filling

167
00:10:47,180 --> 00:10:50,850
so the dumplings don't fall apart while
steaming

168
00:10:50,850 --> 00:10:52,585
If there are too few pleats,

169
00:10:52,585 --> 00:10:54,654
the wrapper at the top won't close tightly

170
00:10:54,654 --> 00:10:57,123
and the dumpling will be floppy

171
00:10:57,123 --> 00:10:58,458
It won't stand up straight

172
00:10:58,458 --> 00:11:01,928
and might even fall apart while steaming

173
00:11:01,928 --> 00:11:03,863
If there are too many pleats,

174
00:11:03,863 --> 00:11:06,199
the wrapper at the top will be pulled too
tightly

175
00:11:06,199 --> 00:11:08,535
This not only makes it harder

176
00:11:08,535 --> 00:11:11,471
for the top of the dumpling to cook
through,

177
00:11:11,471 --> 00:11:14,807
the wrapper on the bottom may also be too
taut

178
00:11:14,807 --> 00:11:17,010
and split while steaming

179
00:11:17,010 --> 00:11:20,013
Wow, so too many pleats won't work

180
00:11:20,013 --> 00:11:22,081
and too few won't work either

181
00:11:22,081 --> 00:11:24,884
Cooking really is a science!

182
00:11:24,951 --> 00:11:26,152
That's right

183
00:11:26,152 --> 00:11:28,688
Cooking is just like practicing kung fu

184
00:11:30,423 --> 00:11:32,225
As chefs,

185
00:11:32,225 --> 00:11:34,961
we study soup dumplings every day

186
00:11:34,961 --> 00:11:36,429
What filling to use,

187
00:11:36,429 --> 00:11:37,697
how thick the wrapper should be,

188
00:11:37,697 --> 00:11:39,098
how long to steam them,

189
00:11:39,098 --> 00:11:42,502
and all the little tricks that make them
taste better

190
00:11:43,036 --> 00:11:44,571
Wow, cool!

191
00:11:44,571 --> 00:11:47,640
No wonder your soup dumplings are so
delicious, Brother Pang

192
00:11:47,640 --> 00:11:49,309
I'd like another serving

193
00:11:50,310 --> 00:11:52,045
No problem at all!
